# Forge's route search orders the quests of this guide and its guide writer writes the steps.
# Fixes go into data/route-fixes.json, data/guide-fixes.json or forever-db/corrections, never
# into this file.
# Split from 30-40/06-badlands on 2026-11-13 (0.4.0 route audit, Refs #2025): Desolace's south loop, from Thelsamar,
# where the Badlands end. Added here: Claim Rackmore's Treasure! (6161, every race), The Karnitol Shipwreck (1456).
# Since 0.3.6 the wreck's chest is opened and handed in on the first Desolace visit (30-40/02), so the satchel is
# dived for on the one trip to the north-west coast, Rackmore's chest is opened right after the Serpent Statue, and
# Nijel's Point is visited once at the end instead of in the middle of the loop as well.
# Since 2026-11-07 Theramore's first quests are handed in on the Dustwallow Marsh crossing at 33-34 (30-40/03): the
# boat lands in Theramore only for the flight to Nijel's Point.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Theramore

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"
  zone Wetlands

step Boat to Theramore
  zone Wetlands
  goto 5.13,63.61 "Boat to Theramore"

step Theramore flight master
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Off the boat, walk up the pier to Baldruc, the flight master by the gate of Foothold Citadel.
  goto 67.5,51.3 "Theramore flight master"

step Nijel's Point
  zone Desolace
  fly "Nijel's Point"
  sethome "Nijel's Point"
  turnin 6141                         -- Brother Anton
  accept 261
  accept 1466
  accept 1454                         -- Kreldig Ungor, if 30-40/02 didn't take it: the wreck lies below Azore's tower
  accept 93224                        -- Captain Pentigast

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Desolace: the south loop

step Bibbly F'utzbuckle
  tip Follow the road south to Kormek's Hut.
  accept 5501

step Kodo Graveyard
  tip Hornizz stands at the edge of the Kodo Graveyard, south-west of Kormek's Hut; Kodo Bones lie among the skeletons.
  collect 13703 quest 5501            -- Kodo Bone
  accept 6134                         -- Hornizz Brimbuzzle

step Flesh Picker
  when onquest 93176
  tip A Flesh Picker crawls about the Kodo Graveyard: catch one with the tool from Amaryllis Webb's Entomology Starter Kit.
  collect 213567 "Flesh Picker Specimen" @48.1,57.1

step Maraudine centaurs
  tip The Maraudine centaurs hold the Valley of Spears west of the graveyard; every kind drops the totems.
  collect 254432 quest 93224.1        -- Carved Centaur Totem

step Melizza Brimbuzzle
  tip Melizza is held in the centaur camp west of the graveyard. Free her and keep her alive on the walk out; she stops by the graveyard.
  tip Careful: The scripted groups are linked and only appear during the escort, so you cannot clear them in advance or pull them one at a time. Clearing the normal centaurs on the path before you start does help.
  accept 6132
  complete 6132 @40.1,61.6            -- escort Melizza back toward the graveyard

step Mannoroc Coven
  tip The demons gather at the Mannoroc Coven in southern Desolace: felhounds (Mana Eaters, Mage and Ley Hunters), Nether Maidens and Sisters, and Doomwarder Captains around the pit.
  tip Careful: Most of the mobs here walk patrol routes, so you can easily pull extra mobs.
  collect 6251 quest 1466             -- Nether Wing
  collect 6252 quest 1466             -- Doomwarder Blood

step The Valley of Bones
  tip Undead Ravagers roam the bone fields south of the Magram village, east of the Coven; at the far south-east, use the Crate of Ghost Magnets to draw the Magrami Spectres.
  kill 11561 quest 261                -- Undead Ravager
  use 15848 quest 6134.1 @63.5,91.6 map 1443
  collect 15849 quest 6134            -- Ghost-o-plasm

step Mannoroc Coven
  collect 6250 quest 1466             -- Felhound Brain

step Hornizz Brimbuzzle
  turnin 6132
  turnin 6134                         -- Hornizz Brimbuzzle

step Azore Aldamort
  turnin 5741
  tip Follow the road west across the north of Desolace to the ruins of Ethel Rethor. Azore's tower stands on the hill there, on the way to the wreck.
  accept 6027

step Karnitol's Chest
  tip The wrecked ship's chest lies just south-west of Azore's tower.
  turnin 1454                         -- Karnitol's Chest
  accept 1455

step Claim Rackmore's Treasure!
  tip Rackmore's Log lies beside Karnitol's Chest. His silver key drops from the Drysnap crabs around the wreck; the golden one comes from the Slitherblade naga on the north-west coast, next.
  accept 6161
  collect 15878 quest 6161.1 @34.7,33.5 map 1443 -- Underwater

step Sar'theris Strand: kill these as you meet them
  zone Desolace
  tip The Slitherblade naga hold the north-west coast north of Azore's tower; Karnitol's satchel lies on the sea floor off it, and any naga can drop Rackmore's golden key. Swim out to Ranazjar Isle off the far northern tip and use the Gem of the Serpent on the Serpent Statue: Lord Kragaru (38) rises; kill him for the Book of the Ancients.
  collect 6245 quest 1456.1 @33.2,10.5 map 1443 -- Underwater
  collect 15881 quest 6161.2 @30.0,12.2 map 1443 -- Rackmore's Golden Key, from the Slitherblade naga
  use 15766 quest 6027.1 @28.2,6.7 map 1443 -- Gem of the Serpent, on the Serpent Statue
  collect 15803 quest 6027            -- Book of the Ancients

step Rackmore's Chest
  tip Rackmore's chest lies just south-east of the Serpent Statue.
  turnin 6161                         -- Rackmore's Chest

step Azore Aldamort
  turnin 6027

step Kormek's Hut
  turnin 5501                         -- Bibbly F'utzbuckle

step Nijel's Point
  tip Follow the road north to Nijel's Point: Captain Pentigast stands at its south end, Kreldig Ungor in the middle, Brother Anton to the north.
  turnin 93224                        -- Captain Pentigast
  turnin 1466                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1455                         -- Kreldig Ungor
  turnin 1456
  accept 1457                         -- for Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: keep it
  accept 1467                         -- for Roetten Stonehammer in Ironforge: keep it
  turnin 261                          -- Brother Anton
  accept 1052                         -- for Raleigh the Devout in Southshore: keep it

step Fly to Theramore
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The next guide starts in Theramore.
  fly "Theramore"
